:====
# Multiple operations

-- 24.0foo as Bar as UnitString
-- 72bar as Foo as UnitString

+ Foo (foo) is F64
+ Bar (bar) is I32

+ 1bar = (1 / 3) + 0foo

:----

72bar
24foo

