# A unit declared through bitwise operators.

-- 8bar as Foo
-- (1bar + 4foo) as UnitString
-- 3baz as Foo
-- 16qux as Foo

+ Foo (foo) is I32
+ Bar (bar) is I32
+ Baz (baz) is I32
+ Qux (qux) is I32

+ 1bar = 2foo /lshift/ 1
+ 1baz = 6foo /and/ 3
+ 8qux = 16foo /rshift/ 2

:----

32
2bar
6
8
